l (“Akrapoint” or “the Company”), a mid-ticket equipment finance company established by a team of experienced industry professionals and KKR. Investment funds managed by KKR will commit $350 million, via KKR’s Asset Based Finance strategy, to support the launch.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:a6616901848330ab6f9c160d72228430","date":"2026-09-15","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Datavant","portco_name":"Datavant","target_website":null,"investor":"Neuberger","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"co_investor","co_investors":["KKR"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Neuberger and KKR to Invest in Datavant Alongside New Mountain Capital","summary":"Neuberger and KKR funds agreed to acquire a significant minority stake in Datavant, with New Mountain Capital retaining control.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=e404ce87-925b-4419-babf-530ea86f5669","evidence":"NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Datavant, the data collaboration platform trusted for healthcare, New Mountain Capital, Neuberger, and KKR today announced that funds managed by Neuberger Capital Solutions, along with Neuberger Private Markets (collectively, “Neuberger”), and investment funds and accounts managed by KKR have agreed to acquire a significant minority stake in Datavant (the “Company”).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:41253ccd5e6a5cf6aab304c7a8e35a2f","date":"2026-09-03","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Avisena Healthcare","portco_name":"Avisena Healthcare","target_website":null,"investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"KKR Invests in Malaysian Healthcare Platform Avisena Healthcare","summary":"KKR funds agreed to make a minority investment in Malaysian hospital operator Avisena Healthcare.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=160e708e-3634-46b5-a408-de6b2900a308","evidence":"KKR, a leading global investment firm, and Avisena Healthcare (“Avisena”), a Malaysian healthcare provider, today announced that funds managed by KKR have entered into a definitive agreement to make a minority investment in Avisena.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:a4c2e44bace3b765d00471859adb53cb","date":"2026-09-03","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Nordic Bioscience","portco_name":"Nordic Bioscience","target_website":"nordicbioscience.com","investor":"Claus Christiansen","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"KKR","round":null,"stake_pct":10.0,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"KKR to sell minority stake in Nordic Bioscience to Founder Claus Christiansen","summary":"KKR agreed to sell its 10% minority stake in Nordic Bioscience to founder and majority shareholder Claus Christiansen.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=c24c0635-296f-415c-bd35-c2200bf970e6","evidence":"Copenhagen, 3 September 2026 – Nordic Bioscience, a global leader in biomarker development, and KKR, a leading global investment firm, today announced that KKR has entered into an agreement to sell its 10% minority stake in Nordic Bioscience to the company’s founder and majority shareholder, Claus Christiansen.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:f0f7abcef3b37c49b237d91735d1913d","date":"2026-08-31","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"USI Insurance Services","portco_name":"USI Insurance Services LLC","target_website":"usi.com","investor":"Aon plc","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"KKR","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":17000000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"KKR To Sell USI to Aon plc in $17 Billion Transaction","summary":"KKR agreed to sell USI Insurance Services to Aon for total consideration of $17 billion.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=80379357-ae02-4bb9-b699-927a177e195c","evidence":"KKR & Co. Inc. (NYSE: KKR) today announced the signing of a definitive agreement with Aon plc under which Aon will acquire USI Insurance Services (“USI” or the “Company”), a leader in risk management, employee benefits and retirement consulting, for a total consideration of $17 billion from KKR and its co-investors.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:e2b25c16d1bb8c068babcaa8f5d5e809","date":"2026-08-27","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"SK Horizon","portco_name":"SK Horizon","target_website":null,"investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["IMM Investment-Stonebridge consortium"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":3080000000000.0,"currency":"KRW","amount_basis":"stake_price","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"SK Telecom Launches AI Data Center Infrastructure Company ‘SK Horizon’ and Secures Investments from KKR and IMM","summary":"KKR and the IMM Investment-Stonebridge consortium agreed a combined KRW 3.08 trillion equity investment in SK Telecom's data center spin-off SK Horizon.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=d43fd044-c7f3-427b-a41e-e2a4e43e9f33","evidence":"In connection with the spin-off, SKT has entered into a definitive agreement with funds managed by KKR, a leading global investment firm, and the IMM Investment-Stonebridge consortium (the “IMM consortium”) for a combined KRW 3.08 trillion equity investment in SK Horizon.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:7a6e79a5eee557634490a95820463951","date":"2026-08-27","date_text":null,"kind":"secondary","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Atlantic Aviation","portco_name":"Atlantic Aviation","target_website":"atlanticaviation.com","investor":"Apollo Funds","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":10000000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Apollo Funds and KKR Announce Strategic Partnership to Support Atlantic Aviation’s Continued Growth","summary":"Apollo funds acquired a significant interest in KKR-backed Atlantic Aviation in a transaction valuing it at nearly $10 billion; KKR remains a substantial shareholder.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=a40dbd14-ea07-4235-bd99-7b72dc949672","evidence":"Under the transaction, Apollo-managed funds (the “Apollo Funds”) have acquired a significant interest in the Company, while KKR-managed funds remain a substantial shareholder. The transaction values Atlantic Aviation at nearly $10 billion.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:6f208a0e0eeb5badc6831e95bea7efe9","date":"2026-08-27","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Westcoast Pipeline System","portco_name":"Westcoast Pipeline System","target_website":null,"investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Apollo"],"seller":"Enbridge Inc.","round":null,"stake_pct":29.0,"amount":2700000000.0,"currency":"CAD","amount_basis":"stake_price","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Enbridge and KKR Announce New Joint Venture to Support Investment in the Westcoast Pipeline System in BC","summary":"KKR-led joint venture with Apollo agreed to invest about C$2.7 billion in Enbridge's Westcoast system expansions for a 29% indirect interest.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=71fb6d7f-50d5-4802-8c84-d5a0b4b42022","evidence":"Under the agreement, KKR and Apollo will invest approximately C$2.7 billion to fund the Expansions, including C$0.7 billion of cash to Enbridge at closing, in exchange for an indirect, cumulative 29% interest in the aggregate Westcoast system upon Sunrise entering service.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:d63cb5197e4db7d505c8365d14613078","date":"2026-08-25","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Ci FLAVORS Co., Ltd.","portco_name":"Ci FLAVORS","target_website":null,"investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Yusaku Horiuchi, L Catterton, eBeauty Group, Yanagi Capital Partners","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"KKR Acquires Leading Japanese Beauty Platform Ci FLAVORS","summary":"KKR funds agreed to acquire Japanese beauty brand platform Ci FLAVORS from all existing shareholders including L Catterton, eBeauty and Yanagi Capital Partners.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=bdfc0728-60f0-45e2-9337-66db8e01ce1b","evidence":"KKR, a leading global investment firm, L Catterton, the largest global consumer-focused investment firm, and Ci FLAVORS Co., Ltd. (“Ci FLAVORS” or the “Company”), a Japanese beauty and lifestyle brand platform, today announced the signing of definitive agreements under which funds managed by KKR will acquire Ci FLAVORS from all existing shareholders, including Ci FLAVORS founder Yusaku Horiuchi, L Catterton, eBeauty Group (“eBeauty”), and Yanagi Capital Partners (“Yanagi”).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:ad2c82056480dca00afd45ec0456d6e3","date":"2026-08-18","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"BookMyShow","portco_name":"BookMyShow","target_website":null,"investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"KKR Invests in Indian Ticketing and Live Entertainment Platform BookMyShow","summary":"KKR funds agreed to acquire a minority stake in Indian ticketing and live entertainment platform BookMyShow.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=6596363f-98bf-4ad7-a09d-36e84aaf7f4d","evidence":"KKR, a leading global investment firm, and BookMyShow (the ‘Company’), one of India’s leading entertainment destinations, today announced the signing of definitive agreements under which funds managed by KKR will acquire a minority stake in the Company.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:9beefe00efdc1087cc1ccf37899f4b87","date":"2026-08-06","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Medicover India","portco_name":"Medicover India","target_website":null,"investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Medicover AB","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"KKR to Acquire Leading Multi-Specialty Healthcare Provider Medicover India","summary":"KKR funds agreed to acquire Medicover AB's India hospital operations.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=6a6c6df1-c849-4af4-a6a2-4fbef3d757a0","evidence":"KKR, a leading global investment firm, today announced the signing of definitive agreements under which funds managed by KKR (“KKR”) will acquire Medicover India, the India hospital operations (the “Company”) of leading international healthcare and diagnostic services provider Medicover AB (Nasdaq Stockholm: MCOV B).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:3e97d53bdb9306e23b0991adba1ab0ce","date":"2026-08-03","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Integer Holdings Corporation","portco_name":"Integer","target_website":null,"investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":5700000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Integer to Be Acquired by KKR in Transaction Valued at Approximately $5.7 Billion","summary":"KKR agreed to take Integer private in an all-cash deal at an enterprise value of about $5.7 billion ($127 per share).","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=74bd6ea3-ce11-4b7f-9ede-f9376434d919","evidence":"PLANO, Texas and NEW YORK – August 3, 2026 – Integer Holdings Corporation (NYSE: ITGR) (“Integer” or the “Company”), a leading global medical device contract development and manufacturing organization (CDMO), and KKR, a leading global investment firm, today announced that they have entered into a definitive agreement under which an affiliate of investment funds managed by KKR will acquire all of the outstanding shares of Integer in an all-cash transaction valued at an enterprise value of approximately $5.7 billion.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:7f357e47f79fa192b6e6c42b2517bdea","date":"2026-07-25","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Kuwait Oil Company pipeline network joint venture","portco_name":"Kuwait Oil Company pipeline network joint venture","target_website":null,"investor":"Blackstone","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"co_investor","co_investors":["Brookfield","KKR"],"seller":"Kuwait Oil Company","round":null,"stake_pct":49.0,"amount":16000000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"unspecified","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Kuwait Oil Company Signs US$ 16.0 Billion Infrastructure Partnership Involving Its Crude Oil Pipeline Network With a Consortium Comprising Blackstone, Brookfield and KKR","summary":"A Blackstone, Brookfield and KKR consortium signed a US$16.0 billion lease-and-lease-back partnership over Kuwait Oil Company's pipeline network, holding 49% of the new joint venture.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=bd292000-9cc7-487b-9c6f-de43fd5a9b74","evidence":"KUWAIT CITY, Kuwait--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Kuwait Petroleum Corporation (\"KPC\"), the state-owned corporation overseeing Kuwait's oil and gas sector, today announced that its wholly owned subsidiary, Kuwait Oil Company (“KOC”), responsible for the exploration, production and transportation of crude oil on behalf of the State of Kuwait, has signed a US$ 16.0 billion lease-and-lease-back agreement involving its entire domestic and export pipeline network with a consortium of international infrastructure and institutional investors led collectively by Blackstone, Brookfield and KKR. KOC and the consortium, comprising Blackstone, Brookfield and KKR, will establish the new joint venture, with KOC holding a 51% majority stake and the consortium collectively holding the remaining 49%, with equal stakes and on equal terms.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:388d8171ffb51e53d2d76df3bda6db20","date":"2026-07-12","date_text":null,"kind":"debt_financing","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Ampol Limited","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Clifford Capital"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":400000000.0,"currency":"AUD","amount_basis":"debt","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"KKR Leads A$400 Million Financing Solution for Ampol","summary":"KKR anchored an A$400 million financing solution for ASX-listed fuel company Ampol, supported by Clifford Capital.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=265f111e-801d-4f4d-b4a4-928b17174f1c","evidence":"KKR, a leading global investment firm, today announced its cornerstone investment in a A$400 million (US$275 million) financing solution (the \"Financing\") for Ampol Limited (ASX: ALD) (\"Ampol\"), anchored by KKR's private credit and insurance platforms.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:cc664897d2de24fa28e7e9ea22e7e3ae","date":"2026-07-09","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Allyntra","portco_name":"Allyntra","target_website":"allyntra.com","investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"KKR Launches Allyntra, an Engineered Solutions Platform for Medical Technology and Precision Industries","summary":"KKR launched precision-engineered solutions platform Allyntra, built on its existing investment in Precipart through Health Care Strategic Growth Fund II.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=734407c1-ca7c-4b91-95e0-46df6b732fb8","evidence":"KKR today announced the launch of Allyntra (“Allyntra” or the “Company”), a newly formed precision-engineered solutions platform serving medical technology and other precision end markets. Allyntra builds on KKR’s existing investment in Precipart through its Health Care Strategic Growth Fund II, with Precipart serving as one of the foundational businesses within the platform.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:0f6e135c4629d59a00a1aba5abf97696","date":"2026-07-02","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Ocean Yield AS","portco_name":"Ocean Yield","target_website":null,"investor":"A.P. Moller Holding","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"KKR","round":null,"stake_pct":100.0,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"A.P. Moller Holding announces the acquisition of Ocean Yield from KKR","summary":"A subsidiary of A.P. Moller Holding agreed to acquire 100% of ship leasing platform Ocean Yield from KKR funds.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=40a1663c-326b-4b4e-81c2-1c1a92903010","evidence":"Moller Holding) and KKR, a leading global investment firm, today announced that they have signed an agreement under which a subsidiary of A.P. Moller Holding will acquire 100% of Ocean Yield AS (Ocean Yield), a leading global ship leasing platform, from funds managed by KKR.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:8cc23cde5830d584e0a003e11c55bd8a","date":"2026-06-30","date_text":null,"kind":"other","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"SK-KKR renewable energy platform","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["SK Inc."],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":2000000000000.0,"currency":"KRW","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"SK and KKR Launch Korea's Largest Renewable Energy Platform","summary":"KKR funds and SK agreed to launch Korea's largest renewable energy platform, combining SK affiliates' assets, valued at KRW 2 trillion.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=d294a153-9bcd-4cd0-95b6-45239bdb3dac","evidence":"SK Inc. (“SK”) and KKR, a leading global investment firm, today announced the signing of definitive agreements under which funds managed by KKR and SK will launch Korea's largest renewable energy platform valued at KRW 2 trillion (~$1.3 billion).","verified":true},{"key":"pr:5168e252b6316dd8ce702fa5bc3d0bfc","date":"2026-06-30","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"EDF power solutions North America","portco_name":"EDF power solutions North America","target_website":null,"investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"sel