ollo (NYSE: APO) today announced that Apollo-managed funds (“Apollo Funds”) have agreed to acquire a 40% stake in Pembina Gas Infrastructure Inc. (“PGI” or the “Company”), a premier gas processing entity in Western Canada, from funds managed by KKR.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:edb3d51e0a12bf7349bb6e01c63d68c1","date":"2026-04-22","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Vertical Bridge REIT, LLC","portco_name":"Vertical Bridge","target_website":null,"investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":1500000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"stake_price","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Vertical Bridge Announces $1.5 billion Strategic Equity Investment from KKR","summary":"KKR agreed to make a $1.5 billion equity investment in US tower owner Vertical Bridge.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=b3b027d6-68d6-410a-b664-ea91ad94ac02","evidence":"Vertical Bridge REIT, LLC (“Vertical Bridge” or the “Company”), the largest private owner and operator of communications infrastructure in the United States, and leading global investment firm KKR today announced that KKR will make a $1.5 billion equity investment in the Company to support its future growth.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:1831b01e5c144d6cdb5a68ceac0403c3","date":"2026-04-14","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Samsung SDS","portco_name":"Samsung SDS","target_website":"samsungsds.com","investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":1220000000000.0,"currency":"KRW","amount_basis":"debt","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"KKR and Samsung SDS Form Strategic Partnership to Drive Long-Term Value Creation","summary":"KKR funds agreed to acquire KRW 1.22 tril