ommitment to European data center platform GTR, with Oak Hill Capital joining with about $400 million.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=ec866a9e-1613-47aa-be38-18b59f8f9aab","evidence":"KKR, a leading global investment firm, today announced that it is making an additional $1.5 billion equity commitment to Global Technical Realty (“GTR”), a multi-billion dollar European built-to-suit data center platform. In connection with this investment, Oak Hill Capital (“Oak Hill”), a thematic, middle-market private equity firm, will join as an investor in the company, committing approximately $400 million.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:e7096880340efe215bc704032eb4f331","date":"2026-01-06","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"OneStream, Inc.","portco_name":"OneStream","target_website":null,"investor":"Hg","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":["General Atlantic","Tidemark"],"seller":"KKR","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":6400000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"equity_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"OneStream Enters into Definitive Agreement to be Acquired by Hg for $6.4 Billion","summary":"OneStream agreed to be acquired by Hg for about $6.4 billion in equity value, including shares held by KKR funds which took it public in 2024.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=8354c111-2b4a-4c84-af3a-0da5bc1a0a3a","evidence":"BIRMINGHAM, Mich., Jan. 6, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- OneStream, Inc. (Nasdaq: OS) (\"OneStream\" or the \"Company\"), the leading enterprise Finance management platform that modernizes the Office of the CFO by unifying core Finance and operational functions – including financial close, consolidation, reporting, planning and forecasting – today announced that it has entered into a definitive agreement to be acquired by Hg, a leading investor in software, services and data businesses. The all-cash transaction values OneStream at approximately $6.4 billion in equity value. An entity controlled by Hg will acquire all outstanding shares, including those shares owned by investment funds managed by KKR, a leading global investment firm, which took OneStream public in 2024.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:ec476daa350a31e36a89a354f883af6a","date":"2025-12-24","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Sapporo Real Estate Co., Ltd.","portco_name":"Sapporo Real Estate","target_website":null,"investor":"PAG","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"co_investor","co_investors":["KKR"],"seller":"Sapporo Holdings Limited","round":null,"stake_pct":100.0,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"PAG and KKR to Acquire Sapporo Real Estate from Sapporo Holdings","summary":"PAG and KKR funds agreed to acquire 100% of Sapporo Real Estate from Sapporo Holdings in stages over three years.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=6c63c4ee-92b6-49ae-8e6f-1a7d2d8b5d37","evidence":"PAG, a leading Asia-based alternative investment firm, KKR, a leading global investment firm, and Sapporo Holdings Limited (“Sapporo Holdings”) today announced that funds managed by PAG and KKR have signed definitive agreements to acquire 100% of the shares of Sapporo Real Estate Co., Ltd. (“Sapporo Real Estate” or the “Company”) from Sapporo Holdings (the “Transaction”).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:669b58fabb490a02d4c6b523dd1b3294","date":"2025-12-22","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Green Mobility Partners","portco_name":"Green Mobility Partners","target_website":"greenmobilitypartners.at","investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"v