bal investment firm, led the round with participation from Sixth Street Growth and TenEleven, as well as new funding from existing Series A investor Carrick Capital Partners.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:532c5b750b0e9ad9d2d51109e87d2443","date":"2025-12-12","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"MasOrange","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"Orange","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"Cinven, KKR, Providence","round":null,"stake_pct":50.0,"amount":4250000000.0,"currency":"EUR","amount_basis":"stake_price","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Cinven, KKR and Providence sell Stake in MasOrange for €4.25 billion","summary":"Cinven, KKR and Providence agreed to sell their Lorca JVCo's 50% stake in MasOrange to Orange for €4.25 billion.","source_name":"KKR","source_url":"https://media.kkr.com/news-details/?news_id=2e27aaca-3907-467e-89ad-a4e2740c1f0e","evidence":"MADRID and LONDON, 12 December 2025 – Cinven, KKR and Providence, the sponsors of Lorca JVCo (\"Lorca\"), the entity through which they indirectly own 50% of MasOrange, today announced they have reached a binding agreement for Orange to acquire Lorca's stake. Under the terms of the agreement, Lorca will receive total cash proceeds of €4.25 billion.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:ca59f4d1546ebe6eaeb8be213bb98654","date":"2025-11-25","date_text":null,"kind":"funding_round","asset_class":"venture_capital","target":"Lighthouse Learning Group","portco_name":"Lighthouse Learning Group","target_website":"lighthouse-learning.com","investor":"KKR","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["PSP Investments"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"KKR Further Invests in Lighthouse Learning to Support Next Phase of Growth","summary":"KKR made a further investment in Indian 